#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:2
#: be3be4407efe4f5d892bd8cc3f8f478c
msgid "ADR 0024：记录用户元数据落在 catalog 记录字段，星标用保留 tag"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:4
#: 88209be345a44de68cc90a0437e51dc5
msgid ""
"**状态**：已接受 **日期**：2026-08-29 **关联**：ADR 0008（修订：catalog "
"为产物持久化）；CONTEXT.md（记录备注 / 标签 / 星标）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:8
#: b82992777e6a40cdb4252447d6ca3f1d
msgid "背景"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:10
#: 81e5d4aae49b4c419498b7a808e76c67
msgid "GUI 需要给轨道库记录提供用户备注与单级收藏星标。备选方案："
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:12
#: 6eeb8093f423477e925a6b226eac3249
msgid "A. e2m2e 上游 catalog 新增 `favorite` 布尔字段（最正规，跨仓 schema 变更）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:13
#: 06d0aa9393b34bedb1f05c8378523e4e
msgid "B. GUI 侧边车存储（localStorage / 独立 JSON，不动数据层）"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:14
#: 891109d5facc4fb1a8a2b58b0662e3dd
msgid "C. 复用记录现有可写字段：`tags`（字符串数组）+ `note`（自由文本），写入口 `catalog_tag` 已存在"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:16
#: 055c5cbd67d1426ba7e22dbab997982c
msgid ""
"一个反直觉的事实促成本决策：记录的 tags/note 本就用户可编辑（记录详情面板），但面板标题叫\"教学标注 (Tags & "
"Note)\"，与 CONTEXT.md "
"画布层\"标注\"概念撞名，用户以为那是系统写死的内容——\"添加注释\"能力其实早已存在，缺的是术语与入口。历史界面名\"教学标注\"自本 "
"ADR 起退役，UI 主术语改为\"备注\"。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:18
#: fe0380a1d3174a75b54aa29633829f60
msgid "决策"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:20
#: cfbd78317417485f84699d04b039400c
msgid "**备注复用 `note` 字段**；UI 更名，并在项目树节点悬停显示备注摘要、右键菜单提供\"编辑备注\"直入编辑。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:21
#: 22c0cb424abf43bd94e74f90ac261fd1
msgid ""
"**星标 = `tags` 的保留值 `\"★\"`**；树节点星形图标点击切换，\"仅看星标\"按 tags 前端过滤（查询摘要已带回 "
"tags）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:22
#: 1829e17ddd364206a6bc67294cc4101d
msgid "不加 GUI 侧边车，不新增上游字段。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:24
#: a0124ac63de444ef8b5f70fdf6677bc7
msgid "理由"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:26
#: 061d59e9c616429a9c3c313e56528730
msgid ""
"`catalog_tag` 已可写，零上游改动；星标/备注随记录文件走（拷贝 catalog 目录给别人即在），与 ADR "
"0008\"文件是事实来源、重启不丢\"的库哲学一致。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:27
#: 81344a95de66462597192a78f39fe7c1
msgid "方案 B 会让元数据与记录分离——catalog 目录拷走或换机器后星标丢失，形成双轨数据。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:28
#: d7c5f21889234f6f98b3589feabc562f
msgid "方案 A 的正规性收益（独立布尔字段 + 后端查询）当前用不上：单级收藏前端过滤已够。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:30
#: 24058fb0bc0c43c1adb7a3f611d8c3d8
msgid "后果"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:32
#: df5fee83e90f47f799bd6c7efdd9ec91
msgid "`tags` 中的 `\"★\"` 是保留值，用户普通标签不得占用（编辑界面应过滤）。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:33
#: fd7494d383e344bb84013efc262039c3
msgid "若将来上游真加 favorite 字段，需一次性扫描全库记录迁移——机械但涉及每个记录文件重写，届时再议。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../adr/0024-record-user-metadata-in-catalog.md:34
#: 00d326abda204f068470fe38e5969b39
msgid "备注与星标仅适用于 catalog 记录；catalog 体系之外的产物（转移等 output/ 扫描项）无此能力。"
msgstr ""

